# WS2812B controller tests

Exercises the pulse configuration the controller asks for, the dark frame at
initialize, GRB and RGB byte order, writes at an offset, range validation,
frame-length validation, clear, the sleep and re-initialize lifecycle, and
transport failure, against a recording MCU platform without physical hardware.
